0037B1  1  18                   CLC                     ; clear carry for add
0037B2  1  65 64                ADC     TabSiz          ; add tab size back again
0037B4  1  85 10                STA     Iclim           ; save for now
0037B6  1  A5 0F                LDA     TWidth          ; get width back
0037B8  1  38                   SEC                     ; set carry for subtract
0037B9  1  E5 10                SBC     Iclim           ; subtract remainder
0037BB  1  85 10                STA     Iclim           ; save tab column limit
0037BD  1               LAB_NOSQ:
0037BD  1  60                   RTS
0037BE  1               
0037BE  1               TabErr:
0037BE  1  4C E4 26             JMP     LAB_FCER        ; do function call error then warm start
0037C1  1               
