0037C1  1               
0037C1  1               LAB_SQR:
0037C1  1  A5 B0                LDA     FAC1_s          ; get FAC1 sign
0037C3  1  30 F9                BMI     TabErr          ; if -ve do function call error
0037C5  1               
0037C5  1  A5 AC                LDA     FAC1_e          ; get exponent
